WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.680
A man snuck into a family's house every

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:06.400
night and moved every single thing 1 in

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.120
to the left. The first night, nobody

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.840
notices because who measures their

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.520
couch? But by the end of the week, the

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:13.160
fridge is blocking the back door [music]

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.240
and the dad is pretty sure he's losing

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:16.800
his mind. So, they call the police. The

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.480
officer looks at the couch, then at the

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.760
dad, and goes, "So, someone broke in to

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.520
move your furniture an inch?" He laughs

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.320
all the way back to his car. They start

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.160
locking every door and window at night,

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.200
but every morning everything has still

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.760
crept a little further until the bed is

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.480
pressed up against the wall. At this

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:34.080
point, their daughter swears she hears

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.880
something sliding across the floor at

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.800
3:00 a.m. So, the dad camps out on the

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:39.480
couch with a baseball bat ready to catch

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.520
whoever's doing this. He wakes up the

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.120
next morning and the couch is 1 in to

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.640
the left with him still [music] on it.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:46.200
By the end of the month, the couch is

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.120
halfway across the living room and the

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.680
family can't take it anymore. They sell

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.840
the house for half what they paid and

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:53.640
the buyer is him. You see, he'd sold

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.760
them that house a year earlier and kept

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:57.680
one key. So, all it took was a month of

00:00:55.760 --> 00:01:00.360
sliding furniture to buy it back at half

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:00.360
the price.

